<title>GREECE: GREEK ERGOBANK TO CUT DEPO RATES BY 50BPS SUNDAY.</title>
<headline>GREEK ERGOBANK TO CUT DEPO RATES BY 50BPS SUNDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's second largest private bank, ErgoBank , said in a statement that it would cut its base deposit rate to 11 percent from 11.50 percent and its current deposit rate to 9.50 percent from 10 percent effective Sunday, December 1. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
